~ start
Az: Fenn!! You did it!
Fenn: Are you guys okay?
Az: We're good. Few scratches, nothing bad.
Winston: Oh Post... I can not believeth I- ugh...
Fenn: What's wrong?
Winston: I'm the worst! Tis what's wrong. I am a failure, Fenn. I hath failed.
Fenn: What? What are you talking about?
Winston: I can't do anything right. I hath tried ambushing thee. I threweth minions in thy way.
Winston: I even hath cloned myself, something I knoweth very well, and nothing worked.
Winston: Tis broken. Tis all broken.
Winston: I do not hath anything left. Thou hast won. Congratulations, Fenn.
Fenn: Wh- why are you being so mean?
Winston: What?
Fenn: You're being really mean to yourself. I had fun today... I think that's more important!
Winston: Y- you... what?
Fenn: I had fun! It was fun, right Az?
Az: I mean, your creations were pretty cool.
Winston: Wait... really?
Az: Yeah. And my workshop looked even cleaner than before. You managed to make all that with the scraps I had lying around?
Winston: Oh- yeah? I am sorry! I can return thy parts!
Az: Nah man, it's all good. You kinda saved me with that inhaler.
Winston: Oh... well... yeah. I saweth a few in thy workshop. I didn't- I mean- I didn't wanteth thee to- to die.
Az: I mean. Az least you DID something today. I sat around and waited for Fenn.
Fenn: That's not true! I had your bangle. I couldn't have gotten around without it!
Winston: And t-thou also saved me from... uh.... from I- Iceton. So... thanks.
Winston: And, those bangles art, liketh, super cool.
Az: Eh... you should be thanking Fenn. He convinced me to get over myself and help you.
Fenn: Yeah! If you died, who else would make cool icy things?
Winston: Hah... I do not knoweth... I suppose
Winston: Art we... art we good?
Az: Yeah. Help me free my Baba, and we're good.
Winston: Ah, of course.
Fade to black, fade back in with characters in front of the door seal
Winston raises his hand, magical particles appear, and then the glowing ice symbol stops glowing on the door.
Winston: All done! Though... tis not much help without the other Wizards.
Fenn: Where could I find them?
Winston: I believe I heard Randy headeth towards the kitchen, but tis all I knoweth. I am sorry.
Fenn: Well... to the kitchen!
Fenn: End of Demo! Thanks for playing Project Misfits <3
do EventFlags.set_flag("15-AzWs-ReachSafety-GreatHall", true)
